# The top band of an expanded island (decision 108): a click there always
# closes it, even where a click on the card's empty space does nothing.

scenario: a card closes from the top, like a click on its empty space
start timer
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer
top-click                           -> Compact

scenario: a card that keeps open on a click closes from the top
panel notes keep
card notes                          -> Expanded expanded=notes
click                               -> Expanded expanded=notes
top-click                           -> Idle

scenario: pinned, it closes from the top too, and the pin goes with it
start timer
click
pin                                 -> stay=yes
click                               -> Expanded stay=yes
top-click                           -> Compact stay=no

scenario: outside Expanded the top does nothing
start timer                         -> Compact
top-click                           -> Compact

scenario: a card hung from a window has no top band (decision 181)
panel timer
panel search hung
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer zone=yes
card search                         -> Expanded expanded=search zone=no
top-click                           -> Expanded expanded=search    # its top is the window's edge: a click there closes nothing
card timer                          -> Expanded expanded=timer zone=yes
top-click                           -> Idle
